      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COMPTON TO AVOID (1) has a strong record this trip with four wins and two placings from eight starts. Was out of placings last time (30.44) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing fifth and beaten 13 lengths. Looks a leading chance on best. FLYING HUGO (8) scored (17.42) last time out at this track adding to an already respectable career. Strike rate this course strong having won six of nine tries. The form out of his last race has been franked. Sure to measure up. ASTON DEUTZ (7) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten 10 lengths into third (23.31) at this track in a OPEN over 400m. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Expected to feature. ROCKLEA EARLE (2) racing over this distance brings the best out in him.",
